(** The counter of pages/counter.soma, as HTML: before any click, and
    after three clicks of +1. main.soma is not under pages/, so the
    language of pages/ (pages/pages.ext) is not given to it: it imports it,
    for [Increment] and, with JSX, [render]. See README.md. *)
Import pages.pages.
Import pages.counter.

("<!DOCTYPE html>" ++ render (view counter (state_after counter [])))%str.
state_after counter [Increment, Increment, Increment].
render (view counter (state_after counter [Increment, Increment, Increment])).
